@file single-file-theme-switcher.html
@description Pure CSS dark mode toggle button with animated sun and moon icons created using psuedoelements, backgrounds,and borders, implemented (in the pattern published by kristoferjoseph) as a single file web component, with the animated mode switch button adapted from a jgarrow codepen, under the MIT license, as shown below.
