 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ -->
<template id="theme-switcher" shadowrootmode="open">

  <style webc:keep>
    :host {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --button-bg: light-dark(#fcfcfc, #1f1f1f);
      --button-fg: light-dark(#1f1f1f, #fcfcfc);
      --button-border: light-dark(rgba(31, 31, 31, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12));
    }

    :host[data-theme="light"] {
      color-scheme: light;
    }

    :host[data-theme="dark"] {
      color-scheme: dark;
    }
    :host {
      --toggle-duration: 90ms;
      --toggle-ease: ease;
    }

    .color-mode-toggle {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      inline-size: 1.75rem;
      block-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-inline-start: auto;
      padding: 0.35rem;
      background: var(--button-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--button-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--button-fg);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition:
        color var(--toggle-duration) var(--toggle-ease),
        background-color var(--toggle-duration) var(--toggle-ease),
        border-color var(--toggle-duration) var(--toggle-ease),
        transform var(--toggle-duration) var(--toggle-ease);

      @media screen and (min-width: 18em) {
        margin-inline-start: 0;
      }

      .sun,
      .moon {
        position: absolute;
        inline-size: 50%;
        block-size: 50%;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0;
        transition:
          transform 0.3s ease-in,
          opacity 0.2s ease-in 0.1s;
      }

      .sun {
        transform: scale(0.6) rotate(0deg);
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%, var(--button-fg) 50%);

        &.visible {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: scale(1) rotate(180deg);
        }

        &::before {
          position: absolute;
          display: block;
          inline-size: 100%;
          block-size: 100%;
          background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--button-fg) 30%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 30%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 50%,var(--button-fg) 50%);
          content: "";
          transform: rotate(45deg);
        }
      }

      .moon {
        inset-block-start: 18.75%;
        inset-inline-start: 12.5%;
        background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow: 9px 3px 0 0 var(--button-fg);
        transform: scale(0.3) rotate(65deg);

        &.visible {
          opacity: 1;
          pointer-events: auto;
          transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);

          .star {
            opacity: 0.8;

            &.small {
              opacity: 0.7;
              transform: scale(0.45) rotate(35deg);
            }
          }
        }

        .star {
          position: absolute;
          inset-block-start: 25%;
          inset-inline-start: 5%;
          display: block;
          inline-size: 0;
          block-size: 0;
          border-inline: 7px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
          border-block-end: 5px solid var(--button-fg);
          opacity: 0;
          transform: scale(0.55) rotate(35deg);
          transition: all 0.2s ease-in 0.4s;

          &::before {
            position: absolute;
            inset-block-start: -3px;
            inset-inline-start: -5px;
            display: block;
            inline-size: 0;
            block-size: 0;
            border-inline: 3px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
            border-block-end: 5px solid var(--button-fg);
            content: "";
            transform: rotate(-35deg);
          }

          &::after {
            position: absolute;
            inset-block-start: 0;
            inset-inline-start: -7px;
            display: block;
            inline-size: 0;
            block-size: 0;
            border-inline: 7px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
            border-block-end: 5px solid var(--button-fg);
            content: "";
            transform: rotate(-70deg);
          }

          &.small {
            position: relative;
            inset-block-start: 50%;
            inset-inline-start: 37.5%;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: scale(0.35) rotate(35deg);
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in 0.45s;
          }
        }
      }

      &:is(:hover, :focus-visible) {
        background: var(--text);
        transform: scale(1.1);
        .sun,
        .moon {
          filter: invert();
        }
      }
    }

  </style>

  <button
    class="color-mode-toggle"
    type="button"
    data-theme-toggle
    aria-label="Toggle color theme"
  >
    <div class="sun">
    </div>
    <div class="moon visible">
      <div class="star"></div>
      <div class="star small"></div>
    </div>
  </button>

  <script type="module" webc:keep>

    class ThemeSwitcher extends HTMLElement {
      #theme
      #sun
      #moon
      #colorPref
      #storedTheme = false

      constructor() {
        super()
        /* const template = document.getElementById('theme-switcher')
        this.attachShadow({mode: 'open'}).appendChild(
          template.content.cloneNode(true),
        ) */
        this.#colorPref = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)')
        this.#sun = this.shadowRoot.querySelector('.sun')
        this.#moon = this.shadowRoot.querySelector('.moon')
        this.checkForManualThemeOverride()
        if(!this.#storedTheme) {
          const prefersDark = this.#colorPref.matches
          this.#theme = prefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light'
        }
        if(this.theme !== document.documentElement.dataset.theme) {
          this.toggleTheme()
          this.toggleButton()
        }
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.addEventListener('click', this)
        this.#colorPref.addEventListener('change', this)
        document.addEventListener('di:ready', this.#handleServiceReady)
        this.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('di:request', {
          bubbles: true,
          composed: true,
          detail: {
            name: 'eventBus',
          },
        }))
      }

      #handleServiceReady(e) {
        console.log(e)
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.removeEventListener('click', this)
        this.#colorPref.removeEventListener('change', this)
      }

      handleEvent(e) {
        this[`${event.type}Handler`](event)
      }

      changeHandler() {
        if (!this.#storedTheme) {
          const prefersDark = this.#colorPref.matches
          this.#theme = prefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light'
          this.toggleTheme()
          this.toggleButton()
        }
      }

      clickHandler() {
        this.#theme = this.#theme === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light'
        this.toggleTheme()
        this.toggleButton()
        this.saveThemeSelection()
      }

      saveThemeSelection() {
        localStorage.setItem('theme', this.#theme)
        this.#storedTheme = true
      }

      checkForManualThemeOverride() {
        const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme')
        if(savedTheme !==  null) {
          this.#theme = savedTheme
          this.#storedTheme = true
        }
      }

      toggleTheme() {
        document.documentElement.dataset.theme = this.#theme
      }

      toggleButton() {
        if (this.#theme === 'dark') {
          this.#sun.classList.add('visible')
          this.#moon.classList.remove('visible')
        } else {
          this.#sun.classList.remove('visible')
          this.#moon.classList.add('visible')
        }
      }

      get theme() {
        return this.#theme
      }

      set theme(value) {
        this.#theme = value
      }
    }

    customElements.define('theme-switcher', ThemeSwitcher)
  </script>

</template>
